{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/2e520be0149b0c965850d188697e7169.avif?t=1770916084\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gachamon, a charming bottom-of-screen idle clicker where you collect quirky creatures from a magical gachapon machine \u2014 all while doing other things on your PC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/6367ada07cee5940a6141adac5aa60c9.poster.avif?t=1770916084\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/6367ada07cee5940a6141adac5aa60c9.webm?t=1770916084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/6367ada07cee5940a6141adac5aa60c9.mp4?t=1770916084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Build the ultimate collection of 100 unique creatures, each generating coins to fund even more spins. Whether you're actively clicking or just letting the game run in the background, progress never stops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/57b9e69930246b9d050f38d84cd6a2ca.avif?t=1770916084\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Creatures to Discover</strong> \u2013 Each one is weird, wonderful, and worth collecting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/97622e656ffb35e4671d347a46e82ed5.poster.avif?t=1770916084\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/97622e656ffb35e4671d347a46e82ed5.webm?t=1770916084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/97622e656ffb35e4671d347a46e82ed5.mp4?t=1770916084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle &amp; Clicker Hybrid</strong> \u2013 Perfect for both active and passive playstyles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/a87f45470bc8060ea11e2c57b8785df4.poster.avif?t=1770916084\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/a87f45470bc8060ea11e2c57b8785df4.webm?t=1770916084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/a87f45470bc8060ea11e2c57b8785df4.mp4?t=1770916084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bottom-of-Screen Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Play while doing other tasks; Gachamon stays out of your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Gacha Mechanics</strong> \u2013 The thrill of the pull keeps you coming back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/7660e8497827579f55ce9906a693a3b1.poster.avif?t=1770916084\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774620/extras/7660e8497827579f55ce9906a693a3b1.webm?t=1770916084\" type=\